                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote5" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 5"><sup>5</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>We estimate 8,947,983.20, or 34.66 percent of prime-age nonemployed (2019), are stay-at-home parents.</p></div>
                </div>
