                </div>
                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote14" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 14"><sup>14</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>See Tables 4 and 5 in Alan B. Krueger, &ldquo;<a href="https://www.brookings.edu/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/kruegertextfa17bpea.pdf">Where Have All the Workers Gone? An Inquiry into the Decline of the U.S. Labor Force Participation Rate</a>,&rdquo; Brookings Papers on Economic Activity, Fall 2017, pp. 1-87.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote15" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 15"><sup>15</sup></a>
